cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Categorical Value Grouping for Thematic Symbology"
abstract: >-
  Python and TypeScript packages with the same rules for named groups of the values of a categorical field in unique
  values symbology: comparing values, checking groups with messages for the person, carrying them over to new data,
  assigning named colours, making the classes and legend, and writing a MapLibre GL style expression. Both packages
  pass one shared set of test cases.
authors:
